.TH "DoAtExit" "3" "2026\-09\-29" "TheCRatTime" "AtExit reference"
.SH NAME
\fBDoAtExit\fR \- run all \fBAtExitHeader\fR.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fB#include\fR <\fBatexit.\&h\fR>
.PP
\fBvoid DoAtExit(AtExitHeader* \fIhead\fB);\fR
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
Call all functions, that was set with \fBSetAtExit\fR(3).\&
.PP
\fIhead\fR
.RS 4
Pointer to \fBAtExitHeader\fR struct.\&
.RE
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
#include <atexit.h>

int main(void) {
  /* ... */
  DoAtExit(example);
  free(example);
  return 0;
}
.fi
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBatexit_do\fR(3), \fBInitAtExit\fR(3), \fBSetAtExit\fR(3), \fBAtExitHeader\fR(3)
